  "title": "Kirby Problem 4.39",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let K be a closed surface smoothly embedded in a 4-manifold $M^{4}$. Describe the subgroup of the mapping class group $Mod(K)$ of diffeomorphisms of K that extend to diffeomorphisms of M. Conversely, is it possible to characterize when a given subgroup of the mapping class group arises as the group of extendable diffeomorphisms for some K inside some $M^{4}$?",
